WEBVTT

01:35.650 --> 01:39.950
Wow! You're looking even paler than usual!

01:39.950 --> 01:44.120
Well, I haven't been able to sleep lately.

01:44.580 --> 01:47.540
It's gotten so bad that I even made
my own lunch for a change.

01:50.500 --> 01:55.710
<i>For Kaguya, it is just the second time in her life
that she has laid eyes on this bento.</i>

01:56.130 --> 01:59.930
<i>Rolled omelets! Boiled vegetables!
Grilled fish! Pickled plums!</i>

01:59.930 --> 02:01.720
<i>And once again,</i>

02:01.720 --> 02:03.970
<i>octopus-shaped sausages!</i>

02:04.560 --> 02:06.560
<i>There was a time when,
unable to admit her longing to taste it...</i>

02:06.560 --> 02:08.190
<i>Kaguya was left with only her frustration.</i>

02:08.730 --> 02:10.940
<i>But that was then, this is now!</i>

02:10.940 --> 02:13.110
<i>Now that she's coolheaded,</i>

02:13.110 --> 02:18.030
<i>she can take the appropriate action
to further her goals!</i>

02:20.450 --> 02:23.200
Oh my, how hungry I am!

02:23.580 --> 02:27.200
My chef's visiting his hometown today.
It completely slipped my mind.

02:27.200 --> 02:30.290
Oh, dear, I feel as if my stomach
and my back are about to stick together!

02:30.290 --> 02:32.590
<i>What's up with Shinomiya?</i>

02:32.840 --> 02:33.590
<i>Could it be that...</i>

02:34.170 --> 02:36.760
<i>she wants me to give her
a bite of my lunch?</i>

02:37.880 --> 02:41.180
<i>Hey, even when she's being standoffish,
she has her cute moments!</i>

02:41.590 --> 02:43.180
<i>If that's the case, then why not?</i>

02:43.180 --> 02:43.850
Oh!

02:44.350 --> 02:46.390
I would love some rolled omelet now!

02:46.390 --> 02:47.350
<i>Rolled omelet, huh?</i>

02:47.890 --> 02:49.190
<i>Sh-Shinomiya?</i>

02:49.190 --> 02:51.730
What, you're hungry, Kaguya?

02:52.190 --> 02:53.980
Well, these things happen!

02:53.980 --> 02:56.980
I'd be happy to share my bento with you!

02:57.320 --> 02:59.950
There's lots of sugar
in these rolled omelets...

02:59.950 --> 03:01.740
so they're sweet and yummy!

03:02.320 --> 03:03.700
There you go!

03:03.700 --> 03:04.740
I'll pass.

03:05.330 --> 03:08.080
As I have been steering clear of sweets.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.250
What?

03:09.250 --> 03:11.460
But sweetness is justice!

03:11.460 --> 03:14.380
I believe you call yourself
"the low-carb girl," correct?

03:15.380 --> 03:17.880
You should try to increase
your vegetable consumption.

03:18.880 --> 03:21.180
But there's vermicelli salad, too.

03:21.180 --> 03:23.890
Are you aware just how much sugar
vermicelli contains?

03:24.180 --> 03:28.390
Not to mention, these are all
root vegetables high in sugar content.

03:28.890 --> 03:32.390
Being a carnivore
doesn't make you a low-carb girl.

03:32.390 --> 03:35.900
If you consume copious amounts of meat
and sugar, you're nothing but a glutton—

03:36.230 --> 03:39.740
Kaguya, you sound just like Ishigami!

03:39.740 --> 03:42.740
I just have to run off
all that sugar, right?

03:43.240 --> 03:44.780
<i>Close call!</i>

03:44.780 --> 03:47.240
<i>So, Shinomiya's laying off sweets?</i>

03:48.370 --> 03:48.870
<i>Then what's the right answer?</i>

03:48.870 --> 03:49.750
I'm so ravenous!
<i>Then what's the right answer?</i>

03:49.750 --> 03:50.960
I'm so ravenous!

03:51.290 --> 03:54.120
Um... Shinomiya?

03:55.080 --> 03:59.760
Would you like to have half of my bento?

04:00.840 --> 04:02.220
Please don't get me wrong!

04:02.220 --> 04:06.350
It's not like hearing that conversation
made me feel self-conscious about eating.

04:06.350 --> 04:09.600
Despite the fact that I can still hear
your stomach growling?

04:10.310 --> 04:12.020
Thank you, but no thank you.

04:12.560 --> 04:14.400
Amount-wise, it's a bit...

04:14.400 --> 04:16.770
Meaning that since I always eat
twice this much...

04:16.770 --> 04:19.020
I'm headed toward obesity?

04:19.360 --> 04:23.450
You're inhuman, Shinomiya!

04:23.450 --> 04:24.530
<i>I see.</i>

04:24.530 --> 04:28.780
<i>Shinomiya has a tiny stomach.
It's not like she can eat a whole spread!</i>

04:29.200 --> 04:31.040
I'm going to go check on those two.

04:34.170 --> 04:37.170
<i>I have no clue
what's going through Shinomiya's mind.</i>

04:37.590 --> 04:40.000
<i>Dammit, would you man up, Miyuki?</i>

04:40.800 --> 04:43.420
<i>If I'm myself, I'll never get anywhere!</i>

04:43.840 --> 04:45.430
<i>Man up more!</i>

04:45.890 --> 04:46.760
<i>More!</i>

04:47.180 --> 04:48.720
<i>Pour it on!</i>

04:50.560 --> 04:52.020
Shinomiya!

04:53.060 --> 04:55.190
You're hungry, right? Eat this!

05:06.740 --> 05:09.580
Sh-Shinomiya?

05:12.160 --> 05:13.500
Forgive me.

05:13.500 --> 05:15.250
I couldn't stop myself.

05:15.250 --> 05:16.460
Right.

05:21.050 --> 05:24.420
You have some ketchup
on your mouth, too.

05:24.420 --> 05:25.840
Do I?

05:26.220 --> 05:28.090
Would you be so kind
as to clean it off?

05:29.220 --> 05:30.100
Sure.

05:32.560 --> 05:34.520
Shinomiya, your hand—

05:36.230 --> 05:37.650
Shinomiya?

05:41.730 --> 05:42.980
Hurry.

05:42.980 --> 05:44.280
Clean it off.

05:47.400 --> 05:48.660
Hurry.

05:51.120 --> 05:52.540
<i>Man up!</i>

05:56.500 --> 05:58.370
<i>Man up, Miyuki!</i>

06:07.170 --> 06:08.340
<i>I...</i>

06:08.680 --> 06:10.340
<i>have such an awful personality.</i>

06:14.310 --> 06:16.230
<i>I'd forgotten about it for so long.</i>

06:19.440 --> 06:22.110
<i>The fact that if I'm myself...</i>

06:22.820 --> 06:26.190
<i>I end up hurting those around me.</i>

06:44.960 --> 06:46.960
Listen... Switch places with me.

06:49.630 --> 06:53.260
Weren't you going to make
Pwesident kiss you?

06:53.260 --> 06:54.390
I've had enough.

06:54.680 --> 06:56.020
I'll step back now.

06:57.140 --> 06:59.270
You see...

06:59.600 --> 07:01.690
people never like people like me.

07:04.570 --> 07:07.990
That's how it's always been, remember?

07:09.450 --> 07:13.530
<i>If you're a member of the Shinomiya Family,
you must never rely on others.</i>

07:13.910 --> 07:18.870
<i>Other people are to be used and manipulated,
and, if necessary, dumped overboard.</i>

07:18.870 --> 07:21.830
<i>You must never let
your anger and grief show on your face.</i>

07:21.830 --> 07:24.040
<i>Crying is out of the question.</i>

07:25.340 --> 07:27.420
Do you remember Toshiko?

07:27.420 --> 07:30.930
When we decided to give our teacher
in the hospital 1000 folded cranes,

07:30.930 --> 07:32.800
and we were all folding them...

07:33.640 --> 07:39.310
Toshiko was such a slow folder,
I went and told her to take it more seriously.

07:40.390 --> 07:42.730
And then she burst into tears.

07:43.060 --> 07:46.820
I said something similar
to Kaoru in sixth grade, as well.

07:47.730 --> 07:52.070
At home, we get lashed on the back of the hands
for not taking it more seriously, don't we?

07:52.780 --> 07:56.080
So, though it was only
out of pure goodwill that I said that...

07:56.450 --> 07:58.660
<i>I'm taking it seriously as much as I can!</i>

07:58.660 --> 08:02.540
<i>You just don't know what it's like
to not be able to do something!</i>

08:03.120 --> 08:05.840
I don't understand how that feels,
so what am I supposed to do?

08:06.880 --> 08:11.090
If you come from a good family,
you don't have to do anything to draw others to you.

08:11.090 --> 08:12.090
But...

08:12.840 --> 08:15.890
in my case, they'd all desert me in tears.

08:15.890 --> 08:17.600
<i>You're just special, that's all!</i>

08:17.970 --> 08:19.970
<i>Time after time, looking down on me!</i>

08:19.970 --> 08:23.100
<i>I'm only friends with you
because my mother told me to!</i>

08:23.690 --> 08:25.770
<i>But I can't take being with you anymore!</i>

08:28.520 --> 08:32.530
It's not as if I wanted to be born
with this personality.

08:33.030 --> 08:35.030
I decided to distance myself from others.

08:35.700 --> 08:36.950
I thought...

08:37.280 --> 08:40.290
that by doing so,
I could avoid hurting anyone.

08:42.040 --> 08:47.380
But the more I tried to keep people
at arm's length, the more hurtful I sounded,

08:47.380 --> 08:50.340
and I ended up hurting scores of people.

08:51.510 --> 08:54.300
But at last, I managed to find peace.

08:54.630 --> 09:00.060
Though it was lonely being all by myself,
I far preferred the sense of relief it brought me.

09:00.640 --> 09:02.980
If it meant not hurting anyone...

09:03.890 --> 09:05.390
it was far better...

09:05.850 --> 09:07.480
to be alone.

09:10.110 --> 09:11.440
And yet...

09:21.490 --> 09:26.370
For the first time in my life,
I fell in love with someone.

09:26.960 --> 09:30.630
I, who had grown accustomed
to hurting and rejecting others...

09:32.210 --> 09:35.300
now wished to grow closer to someone.

09:37.640 --> 09:39.850
Every time I hurt this person,

09:40.180 --> 09:41.850
it pains my heart.

09:43.970 --> 09:45.890
Are you crying?

09:46.190 --> 09:47.390
No, I'm not.

09:49.150 --> 09:51.150
You're stupid, you know.

09:51.570 --> 09:55.190
Now you're even trying to deceive yourself.

09:56.650 --> 09:58.450
Haven't I been through enough?

09:59.660 --> 10:00.990
Switch with me!

10:00.990 --> 10:03.370
You can be kind to him, can't you?

10:03.370 --> 10:04.910
- I won't.
- But why not?

10:05.540 --> 10:07.040
President said so himself!

10:07.040 --> 10:09.710
That he hates people
who hurt others and are unkind!

10:10.500 --> 10:12.500
And I'm selfish and antagonistic!

10:12.500 --> 10:14.590
I fear other people! I'm a coward!

10:14.590 --> 10:18.050
I'm always hurting people,
and I don't have a shred of kindness!

10:18.380 --> 10:20.680
I have to hide those parts of me!

10:20.680 --> 10:22.930
The ugly person that I am!

10:23.560 --> 10:25.680
That no one can ever like!

10:26.020 --> 10:28.190
I just can't be sweet!

10:35.780 --> 10:39.200
I get it. I'm you after all.

10:39.660 --> 10:41.950
But you can't leave now.

10:42.320 --> 10:44.330
You still haven't fulfilled your wish.

10:44.990 --> 10:47.710
To make Pwesident kiss you!

10:47.710 --> 10:50.120
I told you, I don't care anymore!

10:50.460 --> 10:52.880
That's what we all wish for, too.

10:53.840 --> 10:58.840
If that high-maintenance,
unpleasant half of Kaguya Shinomiya...

11:00.590 --> 11:03.100
...were to receive a kiss from Pwesident...

11:06.770 --> 11:09.600
- ...I'm sure we'd die of happiness!
- ...I'm sure we'd die of happiness!

11:28.750 --> 11:30.080
President...

11:30.080 --> 11:31.040
is with the doctor!

11:31.040 --> 11:33.130
I've been told what happened.

11:34.170 --> 11:36.000
Let me examine him.

11:42.510 --> 11:44.010
The quack is here!

11:44.550 --> 11:46.260
That was some run!

11:46.260 --> 11:49.020
I have to hydrate myself!

11:52.390 --> 11:53.770
President...

11:54.100 --> 11:56.730
What shall I do if he's seriously ill?

12:00.440 --> 12:01.530
At this time...

12:02.400 --> 12:05.030
all we can do is pray that he'll be all right.

12:05.660 --> 12:09.790
Let's see. I know what this is.
Just as I suspected.

12:10.200 --> 12:12.160
You're lovesick.

12:13.960 --> 12:16.670
Is there a disease by that name?

12:16.670 --> 12:19.170
Sleep deprivation
due to pining for one's love...

12:19.170 --> 12:21.670
Blacking out when pressed for a kiss...

12:21.670 --> 12:24.180
In a nutshell, that's what this points to.

12:24.840 --> 12:27.100
Like I said, you're lovesick.

12:27.100 --> 12:28.930
Huh? Just shoot me.

12:29.470 --> 12:31.640
You know, butterflies. Pining.

12:31.640 --> 12:36.020
Doctor, people have gone back
to saying "I have a crush" nowadays.

12:36.020 --> 12:37.190
Just shoot me.

12:37.190 --> 12:41.820
Don't worry. This isn't the first case
I've ever seen, so I know what I'm doing.

12:43.030 --> 12:44.150
That being said,

12:44.150 --> 12:48.330
it's still worrisome that you collapsed.
Can you try to be a little more easygoing?

12:49.410 --> 12:51.830
You're still only 17 or so, right?

12:52.250 --> 12:57.840
When I was your age, I messed around with girls
like there was no tomorrow, super casual about it.

12:58.170 --> 13:01.170
And you fathered a child at 17, didn't you?

13:01.170 --> 13:02.760
Why the reveal?

13:03.470 --> 13:07.260
And then my own son had
a shotgun wedding himself at 17.

13:07.930 --> 13:09.510
I guess it's in our blood.

13:09.850 --> 13:14.270
My grandson'll be 17 this year, too,
so I'm trembling with fear.

13:14.940 --> 13:16.850
Why are we talking about this?

13:17.190 --> 13:19.820
At any rate, you're putting
a little too much pressure on yourself.

13:19.820 --> 13:22.900
If something's eating at you,
feel free to spill your guts to us.

13:23.940 --> 13:26.030
Nothing's eating at me.

13:26.280 --> 13:29.530
It can be soothing
just to talk about it to someone.

13:29.530 --> 13:31.540
I said there's nothing!

13:35.000 --> 13:37.670
If I don't give it my all, I'm worthless.

13:37.670 --> 13:40.000
That's why I'm always so intense.

13:40.000 --> 13:40.920
But...

13:40.920 --> 13:43.510
You've really been bottling this up like crazy.

13:44.670 --> 13:45.670
I...

13:46.380 --> 13:49.680
I took the entrance exams for kindergarten
because it was what my mother wanted.

13:50.350 --> 13:52.680
But... I was a total failure.

13:53.560 --> 13:56.190
And I failed all my entrance exams
for elementary school, too.

13:58.520 --> 14:03.940
I could feel my mother losing interest in me
after I didn't get into any of those schools.

14:04.320 --> 14:05.820
That must've been so hard.

14:06.200 --> 14:07.240
I...

14:07.860 --> 14:10.450
Even when my mother left us,

14:10.910 --> 14:15.410
I was sure she'd come get me someday,
so I kept plugging away at my studies!

14:15.410 --> 14:20.330
But you know, it's not like everyone
wants you to be smart.

14:20.330 --> 14:24.260
Wherever I go,
no one will accept me as I am.

14:25.670 --> 14:27.470
<i>Hey, General Affairs Manager Shirogane...</i>

14:27.470 --> 14:29.260
<i>Why the long face?</i>

14:29.930 --> 14:33.850
<i>He just got the cold shoulder
from the Shinomiya girl.</i>

14:33.850 --> 14:36.770
<i>He's dejected over a trivial thing
like that. Can you believe it?</i>

14:37.140 --> 14:38.810
<i>Did you say "trivial"?</i>

14:38.810 --> 14:41.940
<i>Well, Treasurer Ryuju is totally fearless.</i>

14:42.520 --> 14:45.780
<i>Huh! In any situation, once people
look down on you, it's game over.</i>

14:46.570 --> 14:50.700
<i>You're a member of the student council,
you're smart, and you're not bad-looking.</i>

14:50.700 --> 14:54.160
<i>But this is what you get when you grovel!</i>

14:54.830 --> 14:58.870
<i>If you would just cop
an "I'm God's gift to women" attitude,</i>

14:58.870 --> 15:01.670
<i>then nobody would ever look down on you.</i>

15:01.670 --> 15:04.920
<i>How can you expect to be popular with the girls
if you don't show some bravado?</i>

15:06.960 --> 15:08.550
Bravado, huh?

15:08.920 --> 15:09.680
But...

15:10.130 --> 15:11.680
it was spot on.

15:11.680 --> 15:12.430
<i>Shinomiya...</i>

15:13.470 --> 15:15.760
<i>Compete with me on the next exams.</i>

15:16.100 --> 15:20.270
<i>If, for some reason, I lose to you,
I'll do anything you want.</i>

15:20.270 --> 15:23.770
<i>What's this all of a sudden?
I refuse to do such a thing.</i>

15:23.770 --> 15:25.690
<i>Are you afraid of losing to me?</i>

15:26.900 --> 15:27.570
<i>Excuse me?</i>

15:30.360 --> 15:32.200
<i>How insolent.</i>

15:32.200 --> 15:33.820
<i>State your name.</i>

15:34.200 --> 15:36.200
From that day onward...

15:36.580 --> 15:39.330
Shinomiya began to perceive me
as an individual.

15:39.580 --> 15:41.330
It wasn't just Shinomiya.

15:41.330 --> 15:44.250
The whole school became aware of me...

15:44.590 --> 15:48.090
as Miyuki Shirogane,
the next student council president.

15:49.130 --> 15:51.260
Until then, I'd been invisible.

15:51.680 --> 15:52.970
But finally...

15:53.470 --> 15:58.140
That's quite a massive social mask
you've been wearing.

15:58.140 --> 16:01.480
It was the do-or-die me
who kissed Shinomiya.

16:02.650 --> 16:03.730
The me...

16:04.400 --> 16:06.480
who's always going all out,
full of bravado.

16:07.610 --> 16:10.360
To make the person I'm in love with
fall in love with me,

16:10.360 --> 16:13.360
I have to create a persona
who's nothing like me.

16:14.160 --> 16:16.280
To become Shinomiya's equal,

16:16.780 --> 16:20.870
I have to go far enough
to collapse once or twice.

16:21.410 --> 16:22.920
I see.

16:22.920 --> 16:24.710
Boys will be boys.

16:24.710 --> 16:29.000
In that case, you should see it through,
until that bravado becomes your true—

16:29.000 --> 16:31.340
But she was crying, you know.

16:31.340 --> 16:32.130
What?

16:32.550 --> 16:35.760
I'm thinking she might be feeling
responsible, too.

16:35.760 --> 16:38.140
She was totally pale,
looking after you.

16:38.560 --> 16:41.520
You should know more than anyone else
how sensitive she is.

16:41.520 --> 16:43.890
How it worries her to see you
pushing yourself so hard.

16:46.190 --> 16:47.110
To pick up where I left off—

16:47.110 --> 16:49.360
I find it quite stimulating to see the moment
a boy's vulnerabilities are exposed!
To pick up where I left off—

16:49.360 --> 16:51.400
I find it quite stimulating to see the moment
a boy's vulnerabilities are exposed!

16:51.400 --> 16:53.150
At the end of the day, it's that gap!

16:53.570 --> 16:56.700
It always gets to me when I see
a gung-ho kid in a moment of weakness!

16:56.700 --> 17:00.160
<i>I can't give any sound advice
with my assistant butting in.</i>

17:01.910 --> 17:03.330
Even so,

17:03.870 --> 17:06.960
I'm still too scared to expose who I am.

17:16.680 --> 17:19.390
A mask isn't something
that you can easily remove.

17:19.390 --> 17:21.930
You're both being cowardly.

17:22.430 --> 17:25.230
What are you going to do, Lady Kaguya?

17:25.770 --> 17:28.900
I love seeing President giving his all.

17:30.150 --> 17:32.360
But that's not the only thing.

17:32.780 --> 17:34.450
I have to tell him.

17:35.570 --> 17:39.830
It always gets to me when I see
a gung-ho kid in a moment of weakness.

17:40.200 --> 17:40.950
Even I...

17:41.950 --> 17:44.160
understand that much.

17:47.210 --> 17:49.290
And now here's the sketchy
middle-aged man!

17:52.000 --> 17:53.960
Well, not that I didn't see this
coming eventually.

17:54.300 --> 17:55.300
Oh well...

17:55.630 --> 17:57.800
get some rest tonight.

18:38.680 --> 18:42.180
How can I ensure
that President won't overdo it?

18:43.100 --> 18:45.310
President is quite stubborn,

18:45.310 --> 18:47.980
so even if I ask him to stop,
he'll go on pushing himself.

18:48.310 --> 18:49.190
Not only that...

18:49.520 --> 18:53.230
but I can never be articulate when I see him.

18:53.230 --> 18:56.690
Please, will you drop the maiden act? Huh?

18:57.280 --> 19:00.700
<i>How's Shinomiya doing?
I know I've made her worry.</i>

19:05.660 --> 19:07.040
Shinomiya!

19:08.330 --> 19:09.670
How are you doing?

19:09.670 --> 19:11.330
Sorry to make you worry.

19:13.210 --> 19:14.630
What kind of game is this?

19:14.630 --> 19:16.210
This is practice.

19:16.510 --> 19:20.130
If you can't be articulate
when you see President,

19:20.130 --> 19:23.100
then you should practice with me
playing him.

19:23.510 --> 19:25.890
Say whatever you want,
and don't hold back.

19:25.890 --> 19:29.520
We can simulate with accuracy
using the power of IT.

19:29.520 --> 19:31.100
How ridiculous.

19:32.190 --> 19:35.230
All right, then, President, do you like me?

19:39.650 --> 19:40.530
Well...

19:40.990 --> 19:43.490
I view you as a member
of the opposite sex for sure.

19:44.990 --> 19:46.490
What a farce this is.

19:47.660 --> 19:49.500
Oh, never mind. Let's keep going.

19:50.120 --> 19:53.170
The way you won't come right out
and say you like me is so Shirogane.

19:53.170 --> 19:57.090
But I think it'd be a more faithful rendition
if you sounded pushier.

19:57.090 --> 19:59.920
Also, perhaps you should put on
some men's clothing.

19:59.920 --> 20:01.880
Did we have any school uniforms
in the house?

20:01.880 --> 20:05.260
You just said it was a farce,
and now all these demands?

20:09.600 --> 20:10.890
Hey, Shinomiya...

20:11.230 --> 20:13.650
Why the cold shoulder lately?

20:13.650 --> 20:16.520
Because I can't be honest
with you, that's all.

20:17.440 --> 20:20.530
The truth is,
I want to be kinder to you. But...

20:20.990 --> 20:24.490
Her pride keeps getting in the way.
I think that's what it is.

20:25.240 --> 20:26.280
Hey...

20:27.030 --> 20:31.250
This sounds like Shinomiya talking,
it's so convincing, for some reason.

20:31.250 --> 20:33.540
Gotta give props to that maid of hers.

20:34.250 --> 20:38.000
So, when did you first start liking me?

20:38.000 --> 20:39.510
Um...

20:40.170 --> 20:42.380
Ever since the spring of our first year.

20:42.380 --> 20:44.010
Oh, please.

20:44.010 --> 20:46.550
We hadn't even met yet then.

20:47.260 --> 20:49.810
How much do you like me, President?

20:50.180 --> 20:53.060
Probably way more than you think, Shinomiya!

20:54.350 --> 20:57.570
It pleases me that it pleases you this much.

20:58.980 --> 21:02.320
<i>Come on, Herthaka!
What kind of questions are these?</i>

21:03.150 --> 21:05.160
<i>I've done all the listening until now.</i>

21:05.160 --> 21:07.580
<i>Now you're going to answer my questions.</i>

21:08.490 --> 21:11.120
<i>What I want to ask you, Shinomiya...</i>

21:12.290 --> 21:14.290
The you that I always see...

21:14.290 --> 21:15.960
or who you are now...

21:16.830 --> 21:19.300
Which is the real Shinomiya?

21:20.630 --> 21:22.340
They're all real.

21:22.760 --> 21:26.680
Who doesn't hide their weak spots?

21:27.140 --> 21:31.100
I've only been doing
what everyone else does.

21:31.810 --> 21:33.850
The day we kissed...

21:34.640 --> 21:40.150
I was so happy, and I thought my heart
would be bursting with joy for a while,

21:40.150 --> 21:42.610
but then I felt a sorrow
like a knife to my heart.

21:43.610 --> 21:47.990
I wondered why, and it hit me right away.

21:49.660 --> 21:54.250
You won't show me all there is to you.

21:54.960 --> 21:56.210
And then...

21:56.670 --> 21:59.880
I realized that I was the same way.

22:02.880 --> 22:04.590
Right now,

22:05.050 --> 22:07.840
I think I'd like to be the one to confess.

22:07.840 --> 22:09.140
Seriously?

22:09.140 --> 22:10.010
Yes.

22:10.850 --> 22:14.980
It'd be too sad if we were to hide half of ourselves
and become boyfriend and girlfriend,

22:14.980 --> 22:18.020
both knowing only one half of each other.

22:18.810 --> 22:19.520
I...

22:20.270 --> 22:23.030
want to show you all of me,
and having done that, I...

22:28.820 --> 22:30.570
I want to tell you...

22:30.990 --> 22:33.540
that I love all of you.

22:46.470 --> 22:48.340
<i>Don't hide, huh?</i>

22:50.140 --> 22:54.430
<i>Shinomiya, that's what you say
when you have it all.</i>

22:54.720 --> 22:58.440
<i>I'm way weaker than Shinomiya thinks.</i>

23:00.560 --> 23:02.940
<i>For obsequious, cowardly...</i>

23:03.440 --> 23:04.940
<i>and inept me...</i>

23:06.070 --> 23:09.570
<i>...to contend with someone so accomplished,
there's only one way.</i>

23:20.620 --> 23:23.880
<i>All I can do is devote
more time than others.</i>

23:24.750 --> 23:28.720
<i>I'd never show the real me
as long as I lived.</i>

23:30.380 --> 23:34.720
<i>It doesn't matter anymore
what Shinomiya thinks.</i>

23:34.720 --> 23:36.560
<i>I'm going to redeem myself at Christmas.</i>

23:37.310 --> 23:39.310
<i>I'll do better...</i>

23:39.310 --> 23:40.810
<i>than I did at the culture festival.</i>

23:41.900 --> 23:43.150
<i>Better!</i>

23:45.320 --> 23:46.570
<i>Better!</i>

23:49.650 --> 23:50.700
<i>And so...</i>

23:53.530 --> 23:57.700
<i>the night of Christmas Eve will come.</i>
